==Description==
The '''Jolly Crate''' is a [[Crates|crate]] that can be bought for {{Coins|4,000}} as part of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]]. This crate yields ten Christmas-themed skins, all of which are skins from either the [[Xmas 2019 Crate]] or [[Violent Night Event#Violent Night Season Pass|Violent Night Season]].

This crate has only one rarity, that being {{Color|Event}}. Each skin costs {{Coins|5,000}} in the daily store.

==Appearance==
The '''Jolly Crate''' is a festive themed chest with a Santa hat, a red bow and Christmas lights. There is a white and yellow lock, which is opened with a yellow key. During the opening animation, the crate falls down from the sky with snowflakes appearing around it before being opened.

==Methods of Obtaining==
#Purchasable in the store for {{Coins|4,000}}.
#*This can be repeated multiple times.
#Ranks 4 and 7 of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event#Krampus' Revenge Season Pass|Krampus' Revenge Season]].
#Completing the [[Quests#Holly Jolly!|Holly Jolly!]] Quest.

